{
  "id": "WF_D08_PUSH_TO_SHEET",
  "name": "AI D8 - Push to sheet",
  "description": "Re-score and push the A/B call list to the SDR's Google Sheet, matched on account_id, system columns only.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ffb12831-b166-4dd8-947b-9bb5aa77bdf0",
      "name": "Sticky Note 7aae759a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D8 - Push to the SDR's sheet\nDaily 07:00 (or manual): re-score → intel_sheet_rows (current A/B not closed by the SDR, plus anything previously pushed so its band updates) → Google Sheets Append or Update Row matched on account_id. Only the system columns A-J are written. Status + Notes (K, L) are the SDR's; Sequence + Sequence date (M, N) are Jamie's. Neither is ever touched by the push.\n\nFix sheet dropdowns re-applies the headers and all three dropdowns after every push (self-heal): Status = Worked / Meeting booked / Not a fit, Sequence = In sequence / Finished sequence, Sequence date = any date. To change a dropdown, edit that node, not the sheet.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 160
      }
    },
